@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
actor Resident
rectangle "1 Refresh model estimate" as Fetch
rectangle "2 Contextualize activity and parks" as Advice
rectangle "3 Validate and save report" as Report
rectangle "4 Evaluate thresholds" as Alert
database "Last verified reading per district" as Cache
database "Local citizen reports" as Store
cloud "Open-Meteo" as API
Resident --> Fetch : district
Fetch --> API : coordinates and fields
API --> Fetch : model time, AQI, pollutants
Fetch <--> Cache : validated result / fallback
Fetch --> Advice : tagged reading
Resident --> Advice : advice profile
Advice --> Resident : activity advice and verified park
Resident --> Report : category and observation
Report --> Store : validated report
Report --> Resident : confirmation and local history
Fetch --> Alert : live reading only
Alert --> Resident : crossing notification and history
@enduml
